    <string name="sd_r8_w07_auto_ram_help">The app gives each Helper a memory budget based on the RAM it shares, then lets the generator fit the model into those budgets.</string>
    <string name="sd_r8_w07_auto_fit_help">Auto-fit lets the generator place the model by itself. Turn on the custom memory budget below only if you want to set your own limits.</string>
    <string name="sd_r8_w07_manual_help">Manual mode keeps your Helper list but ignores the placement fields. Put raw placement flags in the custom flags of the last step.</string>
    <string name="sd_r8_w07_max_vram_title">Custom memory budget</string>
    <string name="sd_r8_w07_max_vram_desc">Only for compatible accelerators. Phones normally use the RAM each Helper shares instead.</string>
    <string name="sd_r8_w07_max_vram_warning">Explicit layer splits such as diffusion=RPC0&amp;RPC1 cannot use a memory budget for that module. Auto RAM sets a budget per Helper; Components keeps your explicit backend map.</string>
